madai.fish is a baked red sea bream (マダイ) from the Fish Kit.

Author: なちゃっと (@nachat_dayo)
Post: https://x.com/nachat_dayo/status/2119312018633273714
Gallery: https://cda-social.github.io/fish/gallery.html
Kit: https://cda-social.github.io/fish/kit/fish-kit.zip
License file: https://cda-social.github.io/fish/kit/LICENSE.txt

The mesh is madai_lo.glb (408 vertices, 722 triangles, no bones). scripts/fish-mesh.py
sampled its WebP atlas into per-vertex colour and wrote the positions, normals, part
ids and pivots. The swim is a re-expression of the kit's part-id motion, not a copy
of example.html (that file embeds three.js, which is MIT and is not included here).

